DESCRIPTION:SPIRITUAL LAW (ger) + COLLAPS (ger) + THE DOGS (uk) + DENIM (aut) + EXCEPTION (aut) | Arena Wien - Kleine Halle | Time for another NO FUSS XMAS ASSAULT! | Death and destruction this time with: | SPIRITUAL LAW European hardcore heavyweights from the Bavarian countryside. No further introduction needed. | COLLAPS Rocking the skinhead beat straight outta NRW. | THE DOGS …from Wales. Hard-hitting rock ’n’ roll and the perfect soundtrack for a good old pub fight. The only band called The Dogs\, btw. | DENIM Sleazy and dark hardcore punk from Vienna. Bow down to the Denim stomp! | EXCEPTION …from Linz have made their mark on the Austrian hardcore scene. Now they decided to piss off again. Last show and tape release!
